// Every source in a plan receives the pipeline input's signals. As soon as
// there is more than one source, they receive them through a broadcast node
// that fans out to one port per source. Every one of those ports must carry a
// channel: a port without one leaves the executor with a lane-less output port.
from {x: 1}
merge { from {x: 2} }
merge { from {x: 3} }
sort x
